# Deliberately NOT ignored
#
#   src/CodeAnalyzer.App/wwwroot/lib/   — cytoscape, fcose, dagre and d3 are vendored on
#                                        purpose. The graph page loads with no network
#                                        access at all, so the bundle is source, not a
#                                        restorable dependency. Their licences sit beside
#                                        them in lib/licenses/ and must ship with them.
#
#   src/CodeAnalyzer.Parsing/Queries/   — the .scm query packs are embedded resources.
#
# Runtime caches live outside the tree, under %LOCALAPPDATA%\CodeAnalyzer\ (per-workspace
# index.db, WebView2 user data, session.json), so nothing here needs to exclude them.
